1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,680
This 70% discount

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:04,640
is not 70%.

3
00:00:05,570 --> 00:00:07,010
Do the math before you pay.

4
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:08,760
Master, look! It was three hundred thousand,

5
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,910
now it's one hundred seventy thousand!

6
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:11,210
If I don't buy it now, I lose!

7
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:14,010
Were you looking for this

8
00:00:14,010 --> 00:00:15,440
before you saw the discount?

9
00:00:16,190 --> 00:00:17,090
No...

10
00:00:17,150 --> 00:00:20,220
I just saw the discount.

11
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:21,350
Let's do the math.

12
00:00:21,860 --> 00:00:24,640
From three hundred thousand, one hundred thirty thousand is off.

13
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:26,780
That's not seventy,

14
00:00:27,250 --> 00:00:28,330
it's forty-three percent.

15
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:32,110
Then why did they write seventy?

16
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,170
A big number rushes your eyes,

17
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,570
a timer rushes your hands.

18
00:00:37,170 --> 00:00:40,000
What you really need never needs a rush.

19
00:00:40,450 --> 00:00:41,200
Three checks.

20
00:00:41,890 --> 00:00:43,620
What's the price in another shop?

21
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:46,650
Same size, quality and warranty?

22
00:00:47,150 --> 00:00:49,890
And did you need it yesterday too?

23
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,220
So I count first,

24
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,450
then I buy.

25
00:00:58,450 --> 00:00:59,310
Hey-hey, Diyor!

26
00:00:59,310 --> 00:01:01,880
Are you hunting for discounts in the shop

27
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:03,380
or for a bride on the street?

28
00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:06,200
No, master... I'm... I'm counting!

29
00:01:06,450 --> 00:01:08,220
Keep your eyes on the price, bro.

30
00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,750
Math first, bride later!

31
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:13,110
Let the need decide,

32
00:01:13,530 --> 00:01:14,790
not the percent.

33
00:01:15,240 --> 00:01:17,690
Take a photo of the price tag

34
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:18,960
and send it to our bot:

35
00:01:18,960 --> 00:01:19,680
@sahiychishopbot

36
00:01:19,680 --> 00:01:20,970
It works out the real percent

37
00:01:20,970 --> 00:01:22,700
and tells you what to check.

